text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_0816D25E {
    "Todos los centros trabajamos juntos\npara defenfer a los Pokemon\lde los cazadores.\p ¡Cuida el medio ambiente!"
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_081701F9 {
    "Bow! Bowwow!"
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_08178F9F {
    "{COLOR 0x03}Eh\p¿Quieres entrar?\pJaja…\p¿No sabes que en este lugar   \nlos pokemon se recuperan\lde los daños que hayan sufrido?\pEn ningùn caso podras entrar\nsin un permiso especial expedido por\lalguien competente."
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_081B25CB {
    "I’m the DAY-CARE MAN.\pI help take care of the precious\nPOKéMON of TRAINERS.\pIf you’d like me to raise your POKéMON,\nhave a word with my wife."
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_081B2659 {
    "Ah, it’s you!\pWe were raising your POKéMON, and my\ngoodness, were we surprised!\pYour POKéMON had an EGG!\pWe don’t know how it got there,\nbut your POKéMON had it.\pYou do want it, yes?"
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_081B2710 {
    "Ah, it’s you! Good to see you.\nYour {STR_VAR_1}’s doing fine."
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_081B2745 {
    "Well then, I’ll keep it.\nThanks!"
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_081B2766 {
    "You have no room for it...\nCome back when you’ve made room."
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_081B27A2 {
    "{PLAYER} received the EGG from\nthe DAY-CARE MAN."
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_081B27CD {
    "Take good care of it."
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_081B27E3 {
    "By the way, about your {STR_VAR_1},\nit seemed to be friendly with\l{STR_VAR_2}’s {STR_VAR_3}.\pI may even have seen it receiving\na piece of MAIL."
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_081B2897 {
    "Ah, it’s you! Your {STR_VAR_1} and\n{STR_VAR_2} are doing fine."
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_081B28C4 {
    "I really will keep it.\nYou do want this, yes?"
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_086B45C2 {
    "{COLOR 0x03}¿Tienes el permiso para pasar?\pVa, está bien.\pPero para hacerte cargo de Lapras\ntendré que comprobar que tal\lentrenador eres."
}

text Naranja_Tangelo_G00_M16_Text_086BF497 {
    "Centro de recuperación Pokémon"
}
